---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { SECTIONS } from "../data/sections";

const title = "How Much Does a Landice Treadmill Cost? (2026): L7, L8 and More";
const description =
  "Landice treadmills list at $3,999 to $8,904. On 27 Nov 2026 the Black Friday cart price was $4,829 for an L7 and $5,729 for an L8, plus $399 delivery.";

const schema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@graph": [
    {
      "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
      itemListElement: [
        { "@type": "ListItem", position: 1, name: "Home", item: "https://www.treadmillreviewsusa.com/" },
        { "@type": "ListItem", position: 2, name: "By Price", item: "https://www.treadmillreviewsusa.com/price/" },
        { "@type": "ListItem", position: 3, name: "How Much Does a Landice Treadmill Cost?", item: "https://www.treadmillreviewsusa.com/how-much-does-a-landice-treadmill-cost/" },
      ],
    },
    {
      "@type": "FAQPage",
      mainEntity: [
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          name: "How much does a Landice treadmill cost?",
          acceptedAnswer: {
            "@type": "Answer",
            text: "On Landice’s store on 27 November 2026 the M2 Genesis listed at $3,999, the L7 at $5,429 to $7,804 and the L8 at $6,329 to $8,904, depending on console, belt and mount. Its Black Friday checkout discount brought the M2 to $3,199, the L7 to $4,829 and the L8 to $5,729 with the basic console. Delivery and installation added $399 on the L7 and L8.",
          },
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          name: "How much is a Landice L7 treadmill?",
          acceptedAnswer: {
            "@type": "Answer",
            text: "$5,429 with the Pro Sports console, $5,929 with Achieve and $7,229 with the Elite touchscreen at list on 27 November 2026, or $4,829, $5,129 and $6,229 after the Black Friday discount in the cart. The orthopedic belt adds $325 and the TV mount $250.",
          },
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          name: "How much is a Landice L8 treadmill?",
          acceptedAnswer: {
            "@type": "Answer",
            text: "$6,329 (Pro Sports), $6,929 (Achieve) and $8,129 (Elite) at list on 27 November 2026, or $5,729, $6,129 and $7,129 in the Black Friday cart. The orthopedic belt adds $525 on the L8. It costs $900 to $1,000 more than an L7 with the same console.",
          },
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          name: "Does Landice have a Black Friday sale?",
          acceptedAnswer: {
            "@type": "Answer",
            text: "Yes. On 27 November 2026 Landice’s L7 and L8 pages advertised $1,000 off the Elite, $800 off Achieve and $600 off Pro Sports consoles, and $800 off the M2, applied at checkout from 6 November to 3 December 2026. Club and rehab models were not included.",
          },
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          name: "Does Landice charge for delivery and installation?",
          acceptedAnswer: {
            "@type": "Answer",
            text: "In Landice’s cart on 27 November 2026, shipping, delivery and installation cost $399 on the L7, L8 and L7 Club. The M2 Genesis cost $299 for curbside delivery or $599 for white glove delivery and assembly. Landice says self-assembly voids the warranty.",
          },
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          name: "Is the Landice warranty really lifetime?",
          acceptedAnswer: {
            "@type": "Answer",
            text: "On the L7 and L8 for home use, Landice’s warranty card gives lifetime frame and parts, 5 years on the console (3 on the touchscreen console) and 1 year of labour. It covers the original owner only, and only if a dealer installs it within 60 driving miles of the selling dealer’s store. The M2 has 10 years on parts.",
          },
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          name: "Can you buy a Landice treadmill on Amazon?",
          acceptedAnswer: {
            "@type": "Answer",
            text: "Not on 27 November 2026. An Amazon search for Landice treadmills returned only third-party parts and accessories, such as belts, brushes, power cords and lube. Landice sells its treadmills through its own store and authorised dealers.",
          },
        },
      ],
    },
    {
      "@type": "Article",
      headline: title,
      description: description,
      author: { "@type": "Person", "@id": "https://www.treadmillreviewsusa.com/editorial-standards/#shaheer-ali-khan", name: "Shaheer Ali Khan", honorificSuffix: "PhD", jobTitle: "Exercise Physiology & Biomechanics Specialist", url: "https://www.treadmillreviewsusa.com/editorial-standards/#who", sameAs: ["https://www.linkedin.com/in/shaheer-ali-khan-data/"], worksFor: { "@type": "Organization", name: "Treadmill Reviews USA" } },
      datePublished: "2026-11-27",
      dateModified: "2026-11-27",
      publisher: { "@type": "Organization", name: "Treadmill Reviews USA" },
    },
  ],
};

// "More in" links: the other pages in this article's hub group.
const HERE = "/how-much-does-a-landice-treadmill-cost/";
const HUB = SECTIONS.find((s) => s.slug === "price");
const GROUP = HUB?.groups.find((g) => g.pages.some((p) => p.url === HERE)) ?? HUB?.groups[0];
const MORE = (GROUP?.pages ?? []).filter((p) => p.url !== HERE).slice(0, 6);
---

<Layout
  title={`${title} | Treadmill Reviews USA`}
  description={description}
  ogType="article"
  article={{
    publishedTime: "2026-11-27",
    modifiedTime: "2026-11-27",
    author: "Shaheer Ali Khan",
    section: "Fitness Equipment",
    tags: [
      "how much does a landice treadmill cost",
      "landice treadmill price",
      "landice l7 price",
      "landice l8 price",
      "landice m2 genesis price",
      "landice black friday",
    ],
  }}
  jsonLd={schema}
  stickyCta={{ text: "See Landice Prices by Console", link: "#price-table" }}
>
  <article class="ed-article" data-template="editorial">
    <div class="ed-col">
      <nav class="ed-crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/price/">By Price</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">›</span>
        <span>Price Guide</span>
      </nav>
      <h1 class="ed-title">How Much Does a Landice Treadmill Cost?</h1>
      <p class="ed-dek">
        A new Landice home treadmill lists at $3,999 for the folding M2 Genesis, $5,429 to $7,804 for the L7 and $6,329 to $8,904 for the L8 on Landice’s own store on 27 November 2026. Its Black Friday sale took $600 to $1,000 off at checkout, so an L7 cost $4,829 and an L8 $5,729 with the basic console, plus $399 for delivery and installation. Here is every console and belt priced, what delivery, warranty and returns add, and when a Landice is cheapest.
      </p>

      <!-- Byline -->
      <div class="ed-byline">
        <img src="/authors/shaheer-ali-khan.png" alt="Shaheer Ali Khan, PhD" width="44" height="44" />
        <div class="ed-byline-text">
          By <a href="/editorial-standards/#who" rel="author">Shaheer Ali Khan, PhD</a><br />
          Updated November 27, 2026 · Exercise Physiology & Biomechanics Specialist · ACSM-EP, CSCS<br />
          <span class="ed-method">Based on retailer and maker listings, with prices checked on the dates shown.</span>
        </div>
        <a href="#price-table" class="btn-ghost">Prices by Console</a>
      </div>
      <p class="ed-disclosure">
        Nothing on this page is a paid placement, and it carries no affiliate links. <a href="/editorial-standards/">How we review.</a>
      </p>

      <div class="ed-body prose prose-lg">
        <p class="ed-lead">
          Landice builds its treadmills to order in New Jersey and sells them through its own online store and
          a network of dealers. There is no single Landice price: each L-Series treadmill is configured with one
          of three consoles, a standard or orthopedic belt and an optional mount, and every combination has its
          own price. We read every Landice treadmill listing on landice.com on 27 November 2026, Black Friday,
          added each configuration to the cart to see the discounted price and the delivery charge, and read
          Landice’s warranty, delivery, return and financing pages the same day. We also checked dealers that
          publish Landice prices and Amazon. Earlier prices come from our own Landice pages, with their dates.
        </p>

        <nav class="ed-toc not-prose" aria-label="On this page">
          <h2>On this page</h2>
          <ol>
            <li><a href="#short-answer">The Short Answer</a></li>
            <li><a href="#price-table">Landice Treadmill Prices by Model and Console</a></li>
            <li><a href="#options">What Consoles, Belts and Mounts Cost</a></li>
            <li><a href="#black-friday">The Landice Black Friday Sale, and How It Compares</a></li>
            <li><a href="#delivery">Delivery, Installation and the Delivered Price</a></li>
            <li><a href="#commercial">Club and Rehabilitation Landice Prices</a></li>
            <li><a href="#dealers-amazon">Landice Prices at Dealers and on Amazon</a></li>
            <li><a href="#warranty">What the Landice Warranty Covers</a></li>
            <li><a href="#returns-financing">Returns, Cancellations and Financing</a></li>
            <li><a href="#vs-rivals">Landice vs Sole, Horizon and NordicTrack Commercial at the Same Money</a></li>
            <li><a href="#used">What a Used or Remanufactured Landice Costs</a></li>
            <li><a href="#cheapest">When Is a Landice Cheapest?</a></li>
            <li><a href="#faq">Frequently asked questions</a></li>
          </ol>
        </nav>

        <div id="short-answer" class="scroll-mt-24">
          <h2>The Short Answer</h2>
<p>
            <strong>A Landice treadmill lists at $3,999 to $8,904 on Landice’s store on 27 November 2026, and its
            Black Friday sale cut the home models to $3,199 to $7,904 at checkout.</strong> Most buyers land between
            $4,829 and $6,229 for an L7, before $399 delivery and installation and sales tax.
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>M2 Genesis (folding):</strong> $3,999 list, $3,199 in the cart on 27 Nov; delivery $299
            curbside or $599 white glove.</li>
            <li><strong>L7:</strong> $5,429 (Pro Sports) to $7,229 (Elite touchscreen) list; $4,829 to $6,229 in the
            cart. Up to $7,804 list with the orthopedic belt and TV mount.</li>
            <li><strong>L8:</strong> $6,329 to $8,129 list; $5,729 to $7,129 in the cart. Up to $8,904 list fully
            optioned.</li>
            <li><strong>Commercial and rehab:</strong> L7 Club, L10 Club, L7 RTM and L8 RTM from $5,429 to $8,929,
            with no Black Friday discount on Landice’s store.</li>
            <li><strong>On top:</strong> $399 shipping, delivery and installation on every L-Series treadmill we
            priced, no membership, and no returns once it is delivered.</li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            For the brand, models and how they compare, see our <a href="/landice-treadmills/" class="text-[#0F62FE] font-medium">Landice treadmill guide</a>;
            for prices across every brand, <a href="/how-much-does-a-treadmill-cost/" class="text-[#0F62FE] font-medium">how much a treadmill costs</a>.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div id="price-table" class="scroll-mt-24">
          <h2>Landice Treadmill Prices by Model and Console</h2>
<p>
            Landice prices each L-Series treadmill by console and belt. The table gives the list price Landice’s
            store showed on 27 November 2026 and the price the cart showed after its Black Friday discount was
            applied automatically. Both exclude delivery and tax.
          </p>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">L7 and L8 residential treadmills</h3>
          <div class="not-prose overflow-x-auto my-8"><table class="min-w-[680px] w-full text-sm border-collapse">
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th class="text-left font-black text-gray-900 border-b border-gray-200 py-2 pr-4">Model and console</th>
                <th class="text-left font-black text-gray-900 border-b border-gray-200 py-2 pr-4">Standard belt, list</th>
                <th class="text-left font-black text-gray-900 border-b border-gray-200 py-2 pr-4">Standard belt, in cart</th>
                <th class="text-left font-black text-gray-900 border-b border-gray-200 py-2 pr-4">Orthopedic belt, list</th>
                <th class="text-left font-black text-gray-900 border-b border-gray-200 py-2 pr-4">Orthopedic belt, in cart</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">L7, Pro Sports</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">$5,429</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">$4,829</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">$5,754</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">$5,154</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">L7, Achieve</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">$5,929</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">$5,129</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">$6,254</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">$5,454</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">L7, Elite (15.6 in. touchscreen)</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">$7,229</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">$6,229</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">$7,554</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">$6,554</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">L8, Pro Sports</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">$6,329</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">$5,729</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">$6,854</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">$6,254</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">L8, Achieve</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">$6,929</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">$6,129</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">$7,454</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">$6,654</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">L8, Elite (15.6 in. touchscreen)</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">$8,129</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">$7,129</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">$8,654</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">$7,654</td></tr>
            </tbody>
          </table></div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">M2 Genesis folding treadmill</h3>
          <div class="not-prose overflow-x-auto my-8"><table class="min-w-[520px] w-full text-sm border-collapse">
            <thead><tr><th class="text-left font-black text-gray-900 border-b border-gray-200 py-2 pr-4">Configuration</th><th class="text-left font-black text-gray-900 border-b border-gray-200 py-2 pr-4">List (27 Nov)</th><th class="text-left font-black text-gray-900 border-b border-gray-200 py-2 pr-4">In cart (27 Nov)</th><th class="text-left font-black text-gray-900 border-b border-gray-200 py-2 pr-4">Key figures (Landice)</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">M2 Genesis</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">$3,999</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">$3,199</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">21 x 62 in., 3 HP continuous-duty rating, 0.5–12.5 mph, 15%, 300 lb, 15.6 in. touchscreen, folds</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">M2 Genesis with floor mat</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">$4,088.99</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Not checked</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">As above, plus Landice’s mat</td></tr>
            </tbody>
          </table></div>
          <p>
            The L7 and L8 share a 4 HP continuous-duty motor rating (Landice notes it is a laboratory figure), a
            0.5 to 12 mph speed range, 15% incline and an aluminium frame. The L7 has a 20 by 58-inch running area
            and a 400 lb user rating; the L8 has 22 by 63 inches and 500 lb. Every residential configuration was
            shown as available on 27 November. Landice’s store listed no treadmill on its clearance page that day.
          </p>
          <p>
            The list prices were identical to the ones we recorded on 5 November for our <a href="/landice-l7-treadmill/" class="text-[#0F62FE] font-medium">Landice L7 review</a>, so the cart prices are a real cut, not a raised
            list price discounted back down. The cart prices are what Landice’s cart calculated with no code
            entered. We did not complete an order, so check the total on the final checkout page.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div id="options" class="scroll-mt-24">
          <h2>What Consoles, Belts and Mounts Cost</h2>
<p>
            The console is the biggest single choice in a Landice’s price. The motor, deck, frame and warranty on
            the frame and parts are the same whichever you pick. These are the step-up costs on 27 November 2026,
            at list and after the Black Friday discount.
          </p>
          <div class="not-prose overflow-x-auto my-8"><table class="min-w-[600px] w-full text-sm border-collapse">
            <thead><tr><th class="text-left font-black text-gray-900 border-b border-gray-200 py-2 pr-4">Option</th><th class="text-left font-black text-gray-900 border-b border-gray-200 py-2 pr-4">Extra at list</th><th class="text-left font-black text-gray-900 border-b border-gray-200 py-2 pr-4">Extra in Black Friday cart</th><th class="text-left font-black text-gray-900 border-b border-gray-200 py-2 pr-4">What it is, per Landice</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Pro Sports → Achieve console</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">+$500 (L7), +$600 (L8)</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">+$300 (L7), +$400 (L8)</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">A step-up panel; Landice does not publish full specifications for it</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Achieve → Elite console</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">+$1,300 (L7), +$1,200 (L8)</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">+$1,100 (L7), +$1,000 (L8)</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">15.6 in. colour touchscreen, 42 programs, user profiles, Strava and MapMyFitness sync, entertainment apps</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Orthopedic running belt</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">+$325 (L7), +$525 (L8)</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Same; the discount is per console</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">A cushioned treadbelt and “Orthopedic Super Absorber” suspension</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Tablet mount (7–12 in.)</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">+$75</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">+$75</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Also sold separately for $75</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">TV or monitor mount</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">+$250</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">+$250</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Also sold separately for $250</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Landice Vision System</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">$800, separate</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Not checked</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Sold as an entertainment option</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Treadmill and elliptical mat</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">$89.99</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Not checked</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Offered as an add-on on each product page</td></tr>
            </tbody>
          </table></div>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Pro Sports.</strong> The cheapest way into an L7 or L8. If you watch your own TV or tablet
            and want speed and incline buttons that will not date, it is the console to price first. Every L-Series
            machine also has Landice’s control centre with speed, incline and emergency stop buttons, a contact
            heart-rate bar, a safety lanyard, two bottle holders and a USB trickle-charge port.</li>
            <li><strong>Achieve.</strong> The middle choice. In the Black Friday cart it was only $300 more than a
            Pro Sports on the L7, against $500 at list, so the sale narrows the gap. Ask a dealer to show you both,
            since Landice’s pages say little about either.</li>
            <li><strong>Elite.</strong> The only console with a touchscreen and apps. It costs $1,400 more than a
            Pro Sports on an L7 in the cart, and Landice says the console does not include smart devices or
            subscriptions; any app you stream through it is paid for separately. It also has a shorter warranty
            than the button consoles, as the warranty section explains.</li>
            <li><strong>Orthopedic belt.</strong> It costs $200 more on the L8 than on the L7, because there is
            more belt. Landice ran a promotion from 25 September to 5 November 2026 that included it free on the
            L7, which is worth knowing if you are timing a purchase.</li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            If you only need somewhere to put a tablet, a $75 Landice mount is hardly worth shopping around for,
            but the $250 TV mount is worth comparing with a wall mount in front of the treadmill.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div id="black-friday" class="scroll-mt-24">
          <h2>The Landice Black Friday Sale, and How It Compares</h2>
<p>
            Landice’s L7 and L8 pages carried this banner on 27 November 2026: “Landice Residential Sale – SEE
            DISCOUNTS AT CHECKOUT. $1000 OFF ELITE, $800 OFF ACHIEVE, $600 OFF PRO SPORTS. *Terms apply: 11/06/26 -
            12/03/26.” The M2 page read “$800 OFF M2 TREADMILL”, with the same dates. In the cart the discounts were
            applied automatically, under the codes BRPRO600, BFACHIEVE800, BFELITE1000 and BFM2800. The sale runs
            to 3 December, past <a href="/cyber-monday-treadmill-deals/" class="text-[#0F62FE] font-medium" data-autolink>Cyber Monday</a>. The terms themselves were not published on the product pages.
          </p>
          <p>
            The banner did not appear on the club or rehabilitation treadmills, and their prices were unchanged.
            The home page carried no Black Friday wording, only a note that you can pay with an HSA or FSA.
          </p>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">Is this sale better than the autumn offer?</h3>
          <p>
            Landice’s previous promotion, recorded on our <a href="/landice-treadmills/" class="text-[#0F62FE] font-medium">Landice brand guide</a>, ran
            from 25 September to 5 November 2026: free shipping, delivery and installation, plus a free orthopedic
            belt on the L7, at full list price. Comparing the delivered cost before tax:
          </p>
          <div class="not-prose overflow-x-auto my-8"><table class="min-w-[560px] w-full text-sm border-collapse">
